{
  "slug": "azure-cosmos-db-assistant",
  "name": "Azure Cosmos Db Assistant",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Expert assistant for Azure Cosmos DB — data modeling, query optimization, performance tuning, and best practices.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `cosmosdb-best-practices` (Azure Cosmos DB performance optimization and best practices guidelines for NoSQL, partitioning, queries, SDK usage, and vector search)\n- **Agents** (1): `cosmosdb-expert` (Azure Cosmos DB expert agent)\n- **Commands** (3): `cosmos-review` (Review code for Azure Cosmos DB best practices and suggest optimizations), `cosmos-setup` (Set up the optional Azure Cosmos DB MCP Toolkit connection for live database operations), `generate-skills` (Regenerate best-practice skills from the upstream cosmosdb-agent-kit repository)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install azure-cosmos-db-assistant@claude-plugins-official` from `AzureCosmosDB/cosmosdb-claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "agent": 1,
    "command": 3
  },
